'''Jess Bush''' (born 26 March 1992) is an Australian actor, model, reality television personality, and [[visual arts|visual artist]].  Her television work includes competing on the [[Australia's Next Top Model (season 7)|seventh season]] of the [[reality television]] series ''[[Australia's Next Top Model]]'', and playing Nurse [[Christine Chapel]] on ''[[Star Trek: Strange New Worlds]]''.

